<title>USA: Movie Gallery Inc Q3 loss vs profit.</title>
<headline>Movie Gallery Inc Q3 loss vs profit.</headline>
<dateline>DOTHAN, Ala. 1996-11-11</dateline>
<text>
<p>1996			1995</p>
<p> Shr loss		   $0.33   profit	 $0.28</p>
<p> Net loss		   4,487   profit	 3,681</p>
<p> Revs			61,728		   40,373</p>
<p> Avg shrs		  13,423		   13,013</p>
<p>	   9 MONTHS</p>
<p> Shr loss		   $0.16   profit	 $0.80</p>
<p> Net loss		   2,089   profit	 9,503</p>
<p> Revs		     184,533		   99,137</p>
<p> Avg shrs		  13,350		   11,857</p>
<p>(All data above 000s except per share numbers)</p>
<p>NOTE: 1996 Q3 and nine-month periods includes a charge of $0.48 a share for store closures, merger expenses and restructuring.</p>
<p>1996 nine-month period includes a charge of $0.36 from amortization change for videocassette rental inventory.</p>
<p>The company acquired Home Vision Entertainment Inc and Hollywood Video on July 1.</p>
